  "source": "JoyPro curated on the maker's photo (2026-10-12), Virpil's \"VPC MongoosT-50CM2 Grip\" button-map sheet (flat): main drawing shows the grip from the thumb side with the head face (six controls) and the index paddle / lever at the front to the right; inset (lower right) shows the other (index/front) side with the trigger, the side hat and the lower button; markers sit on the drawn controls, not on the number labels",
